# Targeted reforging: the reforge panel beside the armory. Keys are relative to Mods.Levy.Reforge.

Open: Reforge...
OpenHint: Opens the reforge panel. Choose which weapons to reroll, what to roll for and how much to spend.
Title: Reforge
Weapons: Weapons
Mode_Issued: In hand
Mode_Recent: Recent
Mode_Picked: Picked
Mode_Group: By group
ModeHint_Issued: The weapons the levies are carrying now.
ModeHint_Recent: Weapons added to the armory lately.
ModeHint_Picked: Weapons you click in the storage grid and on the weapon rack.
ModeHint_Group: Every weapon of the class and type chosen below.
ModeNote_Issued: The weapons the levies carry now.
ModeNote_Recent: Weapons added lately.
ModeNote_Picked: Weapons you pick by hand.
ModeNote_Group: Every weapon the class and type below allow.
RecentWithin: Added within
RecentHint: How far back a weapon counts as recent, in world days.
Day: "{0} day"
Days: "{0} days"
PickOn: Picking on
PickOff: Picking off
PickHint: While picking is on, click a weapon in the grid or on the weapon rack to pick it. Click it again to drop it.
PickClear: Clear ({0})
PickClearHint: Drops every pick.
Class: Class
Category: Type
Any: Any
ClassHint: Only weapons of this class.
CategoryHint: Only weapons of this type, such as bows.
Goal: Roll for
GoalHint: A floor rerolls each weapon until its modifier is in the top slice of what it can roll. A named modifier rerolls until that one comes up.
GoalPrefix: Modifier: {0}
PrefixOption: "{0} ({1})"
Cap: Spend at most
CapHint: The run stops before it spends more than this.
NoCap: No cap
PvLine: "{0} weapons, about {1}"
PvSelected: "{0} selected."
PvMet: "{0} already there."
PvNA: "{0} cannot take it."
PvCap: Spending stops at {0}.
PvIssuedClient: Counted when the run starts.
Run: Reforge
RunHint: Rerolls the weapons chosen here. Each roll costs the standard reforge price from the barracks treasury.
NoTargets: No weapons match this reforge.
NothingToDo: All {0} chosen weapons already meet the goal or cannot take it.
Report: Reforged {0} weapons in {1} rolls for {2}; {3} reached the goal.
CapReached: Stopped at the spending cap of {0}. {1} weapons were left short.
